sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]
    Note over App, Node: Allowed states: all (standby, scanning, initiating, connected).<br>Terminates the current activity and returns to standby.<br>From standby, still yields CurrentState(standby).
    App->>Node: GapCentral.Standby()
    Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(standby)
